<title>USA: Hasbro to make Star Wars toys through 1998.</title>
<headline>Hasbro to make Star Wars toys through 1998.</headline>
<dateline>PAWTUCKET, R.I. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hasbro Inc said Wednesday that privately held Lucasfilm Ltd has extended its licensing agreements with the company to make Star Wars toys, games, puzzles and related products through 1998.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the value of the license agreement.</p>
<p>Hasbro Inc makes toys, games, interactive software, puzzles and infant care products, internationally and in the U.S.</p>
</text>
